Depends: libasound2t64 | libasound2, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libcups2t64 | libcups2, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libatk1.0-0t64 | libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64 | libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatspi2.0-0t64 | libatspi2.0-0, libcairo2, libdbus-1-3, libexpat1, libgbm1, libnspr4, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libudev1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Maintainer: Community <community@netease.com>
Homepage: https://music.163.com/
Description: NetEase Cloud Music for Linux (Ubuntu 22.04 / 24.04 & Debian)
 NetEase Cloud Music desktop client adapted for modern Linux distributions
 including Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (Jammy) and Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (Noble).
 Features native HTML5 audio playback, QR code login with persistent cookies,
 local image caching, and Wayland/X11 compatibility.
